00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:35.000
knowing about a bias doesn't mean he doesn't exhibit that's exact bias. And that's what I found in my personal experience that, you know, I'd spent years studying self-control and, you know, I'd worked with the Bing sample, which is that, you know, the famous sample of marshmallow kids from the Stanford Bing Elementary School. You know, I actually was able to kind of work with some of those original students and learn a lot about self-control and making hot decisions. And so I thought that when you put me at a poker table with all this pressure and all this emotional stuff going on, that I'd have all
了解一种偏见并不意味着他不会表现出那种偏见。这就是我在个人经历中发现的，你知道，我花了好几年时间研究自我控制，你知道，我曾与“宾氏样本”（Bing sample）合作过，也就是斯坦福宾氏小学著名的棉花糖实验儿童样本。你知道，我实际上能够与其中一些最初的学生一起工作，并学到了很多关于自我控制和做出“热”决策的知识。所以我以为，当你把我放在一个充满压力和情绪波动的扑克桌上时，我会拥有所有的

